                                                "sense_id": "7eb3c092-16e9-3e07-8fed-bf8e2d9650d0",
                                                "text": "c. 1680, John Tillotson, The indispensable necessity of the knowledge of the Holy Scripture\nBlanch over the blackest and most absurd things."
